Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, python3 (>= 3.14), python3 (<< 3.15), python3-venv, python3-pip, postgresql-18, postgresql-18-pgvector, libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, zlib1g
Description: local-first MCP/RAG memory for AI agents
 Local Optimize provides scoped PostgreSQL/pgvector retrieval, GraphRAG,
 local Intel XPU reranking and local-only Ollama/MCP integration.
 .
 This package installs application files, runtime/model synchronization policy,
 and provisions the shared Python 3.14 Intel XPU environment and models on the
 target machine during package configuration.
 User services remain inactive until secrets and projects are configured.
